 stockton's voice  never heard it he's so reticent i mean  he he could have sounded  like scottie pippen he could have  sounded like my mom like i had no idea  what he was gonna sound like  but i respected him more for saying no  it's not it's not that i don't want to  do it it's just that i don't feel like  gushing about michael jordan for a half  hour and you guys putting it  he's still it still stings  those losses oh reggie miller was on a  couple of weeks ago jace  i mean reggie's another guy reggie's  another guy man  and we tried and tried and tried it and  we were getting official nose from  reggie  um and gail degasino who's his manager i  had to reach out to her personally and  assure her like we were doing this the  right way  we were getting no's from him and then i  was listening to him called games  and he was saying you know i haven't  gotten a call yet i'm hoping to be a  part of this thing and i was like  reggie we're dying for you to be a part  of this but it still stings with these  guys  um larry bird is is um legendarily  larry legend no pun intended legendarily  uh reluctant to speak about anything he  just doesn't like doing these interviews  um  but it's like i said before that when  when michael calls people pick up on the  first ring  so magic said i don't know if this  happened but magic told me that  when he did it he called larry and said  you have to do it because i did  it's this it's this incredible you know  mount rushmore of guys who who have this  this  kind of pact that they all are going to  tell each other stories it's really cool  to  to observe what was your reaction when  the uh you know  ken burns who does documentaries for a  living  said that this really wasn't a  documentary the last stance how did you  react to that  uh ken burns is one of my idols  he's got an extraordinary body of work  and and he's one of the reasons why i  wanted to  to do what would i do now so um  i was a little disappointed that he  hadn't seen it