dio mix and the final color  correction any day now  i watch that i give my notes they  incorporate my notes i watch it a final  time and then that's that so i think  if we talk again i think that uh when we  talk again it'll be  it'll be done i'll a plume of white  smoke will come out of a  high rise in tribeca you'll see we'll  have our next pope  um i i think there's gonna be it feels  like  there there's gonna be an eleventh  episode am i crazy in saying that has  that been discussed  it has not been discussed okay uh i just  came up with it we discussed it so  you can say it's in in discussion you've  had discussions  we had a discussion here jason we it's  been it's been discussed that there will  be an election  with any partners who would who would  greenlight it and i i love seeing kobe  you know you don't realize how impactful  those words are  until obviously with what happened but  i i thought it was just such a mature  way to approach this  jordan legacy of i'm not there with him  he's the reason why i am where i am i i  those  it was i mean it hit hard for me it hit  hard uh i haven't seen these episodes in  a long time  because we signed off on these  pre-covered and it's been such a  uh race to the finish line um  you know after he passed away it was  always striking in the edit room to see  him come up  i will never wrap my head around it i  don't think any of us will it doesn't  make sense that someone who who seemed  that  vibrant and vital and immortal frankly  uh could be gone so  it's you know it's not the most  articulate way to say  man but it is so sad to watch that last  night was so sad it's so poignant  because of michael's speech too at the  at the memorial  you know that from both sides that's  confirmed this is not just athlete bs  and yeah he's my big brother he really  felt  that way about him and michael really  felt that way about kobe it was such a  special relationship there's such  kindred spirits  um and to say it hit home is y